            </staff>
            <div xml:id="m-4e8519cb-7779-4066-9340-82f22902d9ca">
              <lg xml:id="m-1c6f0562-abf1-49b1-9f94-ed904211f78e">
                <l xml:id="m-5bf4f6af-480e-47bd-8a15-d89387e7d6c8" facs="#m-6e11ee71-30c6-4e4f-9203-187e4833af11" label="text-like">The Ascension of Our Lord.</l><l xml:id="m-e3e12384-24ac-4663-9b6a-975d06039a15" facs="#m-32ebffaf-35f8-4ded-bd67-3c3502083f29" label="ambiguous">847</l><l xml:id="m-65381d21-35ab-4cab-8b94-e25d809a7059" facs="#m-2cadffdb-b61c-4cc3-96dd-c84d978fcc61" label="lyrics-like">ci-éntes in caé-lum? alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-ab62ce99-42df-496d-ab57-9baac65a45f4" facs="#m-0e59f359-902e-4121-8edb-cbfd88886cde" label="lyrics-like">lú- ia: quemádmodum vi-dí¬</l><l xml:id="m-46ae6b5d-6c73-4a75-89d9-6c9985efb4d7" facs="#m-492b037e-d757-4d31-9117-8e4ca71df5ef" label="lyrics-like">stis é- um ascendéntem in caé-lum, i-ta vé- ni- et, alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-575f179f-0cf0-43e8-a198-00b5fa12c3c1" facs="#m-49073290-8f4c-4260-86df-60ae6c37bcb6" label="lyrics-like">lú- ia, alle- lú-ia, alle- lú- ia. Ps. Omnes géntes</l><l xml:id="m-ae63fed4-bf51-4723-a560-ffb22ae5ed76" facs="#m-554ce946-a5d4-45c6-8d48-20013e5f5679" label="lyrics-like">pláudi-te máni-bus: * ju-bi-lá-te Dé-o in vóce exsulta¬</l><l xml:id="m-9c139c49-1a46-4e49-8910-a72155e2be22" facs="#m-df388ec8-829e-4531-8b1f-15944589da6e" label="lyrics-like">ti-6- nis. Gló-ri-a Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-eeade107-db2f-4977-a45e-801d5e82574a" facs="#m-3c93f6a4-c354-4b94-b02d-1b3015e2f054" label="ambiguous">E u ou a e.</l><l xml:id="m-fc6a9b6c-6954-4814-b9b8-4d75f7df7070" facs="#m-017e8b4e-53e4-420a-848f-6dd6324f8abb" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-1f3a8601-b51f-46cd-b45c-ef2ef19d6c09" facs="#m-32a66569-8bfd-40f4-b7cb-580a6dfd2044" label="lyrics-like">(VOncéde, quaésumus omnipotens mus, * ipsi quoque mente in caelé¬</l><l xml:id="m-ccf895bd-85c2-4026-964d-76d0e6013aa2" facs="#m-0ce70827-3162-4621-90c3-263559236ea8" label="lyrics-like">U Deus: f ut qui hodiérna die</l><l xml:id="m-f75515fa-987a-4e4d-8fd2-3024aa46bf69" facs="#m-bce03842-6755-4582-845e-dd975228a163" label="lyrics-like">stibus habitémus. Per eúmdem Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-ace68bf0-d92d-4d43-b30a-81e4743b1914" facs="#m-1aaee97a-4620-453e-82c4-0ef95899f8c1" label="ambiguous">minum.</l><l xml:id="m-31edd82a-ff85-42f6-8803-88a6db89fbe2" facs="#m-75c4f933-7391-420a-a01c-f12aba3ab6ab" label="lyrics-like">Unigénitum tuum Redemptórem no¬</l><l xml:id="m-c38cfde8-3c00-4421-b8b0-110aa0a1b2a3" facs="#m-301c1423-d8da-4b1d-b7d4-2b1c2688bc13" label="lyrics-like">strum ad caelos ascendisse crédi¬</l><l xml:id="m-51dec16a-3ef0-4fc6-8193-72cb03f06205" facs="#m-1329e3be-6012-45fd-99f0-cecfa7650f44" label="ambiguous">Lectio Actuum Apostolorum. Act. 1.</l><l xml:id="m-6afbbe20-67a6-4865-b2c7-1558cd87cec9" facs="#m-c8706980-11de-4551-9d26-9aac4cdf2f27" label="lyrics-like">Rimum quidem sermónem feci</l><l xml:id="m-b8e63118-2572-48c4-ac1f-0f415257dabe" facs="#m-50495c38-9bfb-43d6-bfe4-ea2af12aadfd" label="ambiguous">hoc restitues regnum Israel? Dixit</l><l xml:id="m-e132f3d0-d9c9-4035-a183-a73cfae2b5c0" facs="#m-273ddfd3-5829-48dc-a016-96665f2d474d" label="lyrics-like">Lde ómnibus, o Theóphile, quae</l><l xml:id="m-dd4fcf5b-284c-4ccf-be01-c364a3abfcee" facs="#m-83ec86fa-e480-44ec-96ee-a492df61192c" label="ambiguous">autem eis: Non est vestrum nosse</l><l xml:id="m-c14a3c97-87f4-494c-b7d0-1e4a3386a5a8" facs="#m-bc225bb1-440b-42bf-abcb-310b2760a7c1" label="lyrics-like">coepit Jesus fácere et docére, usque</l><l xml:id="m-fa869e1b-259d-400f-b5bf-bf713f859b26" facs="#m-dff7520e-ad8e-4be2-a163-189e53272f4a" label="lyrics-like">témpora vel moménta, quae Pater</l><l xml:id="m-3ceea952-d106-46c6-a061-f5859b47fa6d" facs="#m-db9a9433-fd4e-45be-b5c0-e4b7a8b57013" label="lyrics-like">in diem, qua praecípiens Apóstolis</l><l xml:id="m-725b0a0a-8afb-4993-91d4-52f86414183a" facs="#m-c3820959-07a2-4d5c-aa4b-633d5e910455" label="lyrics-like">pósuit in sua potestáte; sed acci¬</l><l xml:id="m-14d71f68-39f5-4850-84e4-8540b28fc9d6" facs="#m-e83ce29b-d080-438f-bde9-2f9ff70dd2f1" label="lyrics-like">piétis virtútem superveniéntis Spi¬</l><l xml:id="m-3a71cc71-bc5c-4f1d-b161-f840689dcd79" facs="#m-03fc9e3c-3403-4976-82b1-c77e9c420d04" label="lyrics-like">per Spiritum Sanctum, quos elégit,</l><l xml:id="m-19a49231-e564-42fd-be2e-7e2010410bd1" facs="#m-d00d0e83-9c21-4478-b2c5-ae316ddc2235" label="lyrics-like">ritus Sancti in vos, et éritis mihi</l><l xml:id="m-a8d999cf-a880-45c5-89ff-e2845a71fb93" facs="#m-cb69e0d4-d1fa-492c-b10d-6e94bcddcc8c" label="lyrics-like">assúmptus est: quibus et praébuit</l><l xml:id="m-5446bb63-c29e-4d1c-8c53-0fa31c1510b2" facs="#m-5ddf14f0-d09d-47c7-ab89-a9e53cf0343e" label="lyrics-like">testes in Jerúsalem, et in omni Iu¬</l><l xml:id="m-10882c4e-8f80-4fae-843b-de4f755a7341" facs="#m-2e0ff3af-6219-486c-940c-46714686c934" label="lyrics-like">seípsum vivum post passiónem</l><l xml:id="m-b1fc9f53-435a-40a9-98fe-3d145eb6f5bf" facs="#m-9411ba06-78ce-4b9a-8271-1ab639a3cda4" label="lyrics-like">daéa, et Samaria, et usque ad úiti¬</l><l xml:id="m-90e824fc-070b-43a5-8ce1-3cb308183151" facs="#m-69a87044-2c0a-4488-830c-a84c6024fb01" label="lyrics-like">suam in multis arguméntis, per dies</l><l xml:id="m-28130ab4-98d3-4750-9c48-f513595590dd" facs="#m-6b567652-92a0-4598-893a-e3f040bbb5f6" label="lyrics-like">quadraginta appárens eis, et lo¬</l><l xml:id="m-82cf9185-fde9-410b-8718-ff5b01a25058" facs="#m-0ff079ed-9515-4589-b2a2-9e153795ada2" label="lyrics-like">mum terrae. Et cum haec dixísset,</l><l xml:id="m-e249567e-e669-4cee-a677-657f3b643a87" facs="#m-f782de86-f70f-450a-a44a-d8ac7b976386" label="lyrics-like">vidéntibus illis, elevátus est, et nu¬</l><l xml:id="m-87204330-eb6e-4ea8-a24d-896af4cfce8a" facs="#m-937ab03a-d0d0-4d13-bc9d-df940d992571" label="lyrics-like">quens de regno Dei. Et convéscens,</l><l xml:id="m-103f6baa-4b24-4ecc-b011-eddb1920dd6f" facs="#m-7c46b939-593c-4e29-a610-22b2759aa7df" label="lyrics-like">praecépit eis ab Jerosólymis ne dis¬</l><l xml:id="m-8d69668d-d65a-4cfa-a8df-5d7c40d4343e" facs="#m-86c02ab6-8a18-4073-9714-c5fad1f8b29c" label="lyrics-like">bes suscépit eum ab óculis eórum.</l><l xml:id="m-d68c2793-63ff-4e66-ac18-bcb048d939b0" facs="#m-f706e002-65dc-4dfb-9816-0f508e8e241d" label="lyrics-like">céderent, sed exspectárent promis¬</l><l xml:id="m-5bc6dc43-3e6e-4932-96dc-e1e6711d0d1a" facs="#m-f2787a15-d34f-4ba6-bf1a-01226f71c8d0" label="lyrics-like">Cumque intueréntur in caelum eún¬</l><l xml:id="m-5986f8e2-45e3-4985-b9f2-6dca976d56dd" facs="#m-340d26d6-65b9-42df-8e2b-4056d12b2755" label="lyrics-like">siónem Patris, quam audístis (in¬</l><l xml:id="m-4369596c-98a3-4edc-86c9-1489ab3b4f8e" facs="#m-73f8102c-57f4-463c-8e2d-602e61dea84f" label="lyrics-like">tem illum, ecce duo viri adstitérunt</l><l xml:id="m-21d5dac8-32bb-487f-8dbb-79c2e3052eb5" facs="#m-7aa72f6b-49df-409a-bcd9-30ed6aec2802" label="lyrics-like">quit) per os meum; quia Joánnes</l><l xml:id="m-97feab8c-93b0-4fb7-9f3b-0270510d53dd" facs="#m-aff40445-efe4-4429-a709-241bbd5d8947" label="lyrics-like">juxta illos in véstibus albis, qui et</l><l xml:id="m-b6e1761d-fa3c-4874-a49d-218fc590db1f" facs="#m-864e793a-992c-42de-8072-e209b5b3520e" label="lyrics-like">dixérunt: Viri Galilaéi, quid statis</l><l xml:id="m-921ba685-df16-4fbb-8de6-3d22b3121c1f" facs="#m-d3abe08a-7399-4a69-8b12-00363ce57ae1" label="lyrics-like">quidem baptizávit aqua, vos autem</l><l xml:id="m-36977b14-62ca-4ab7-a169-9b12fb733c47" facs="#m-685b9fba-a023-42b5-92f5-9a6afcf743cf" label="ambiguous">baptizabimini Spiritu Sancto non</l><l xml:id="m-392d0a29-25d0-4891-9a74-4d02fd352c0c" facs="#m-2b92900b-8df4-43c6-a580-4967fec40c73" label="lyrics-like">adspiciéntes in caelum? Hic Jesus,</l><l xml:id="m-7458fb80-32cf-4cd7-adb2-d76c4e1e1aa0" facs="#m-8c951eb7-43ee-4828-8ea7-d841f30c45f7" label="ambiguous">post multos hos dies. Igitur qui</l><l xml:id="m-76709a77-f7d5-44cc-ba08-f00b8853f6e8" facs="#m-1b3f670e-07c4-4cdc-a41e-99a4459e41ba" label="lyrics-like">qui assúmptus est a vobis in cae¬</l><l xml:id="m-d226d524-52af-4133-aca9-806184a88f89" facs="#m-d8d585c8-f646-4729-9c71-2a5088996c7a" label="lyrics-like">convénerant, interrogábant eum,</l><l xml:id="m-73d634a7-584e-4de3-8dcb-273e06f210cf" facs="#m-a801ee24-aad7-46f2-baf3-ef1217ee0ec2" label="lyrics-like">lum, sic véniet, quemádmodum vi¬</l><l xml:id="m-ae5baf1a-4fea-4312-8d00-8bb36b49492e" facs="#m-03ecf340-40f5-41c1-a227-0c7fd21c5ab7" label="lyrics-like">dicéntes: Dómine, si in témpore distis eum eúntem in caelum.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>